Date: Wed, 30 Sep 2026 01:26:28 -0400
Subject: [PATCH] server: Keep the other opens of a renamed file on its new
 name.

A name belongs to the file on Windows, so after a rename through one
handle, NtQueryInformationFile and GetFinalPathNameByHandle on another
handle report the new name, as two tests expect.  The server moved only
the renaming fd, and the other fds kept the old path, which is also what
their delete on close would have unlinked -- a file created there
meanwhile rather than the renamed one.  The opens by the old name and
the deletes pending on it now follow the file; opens through another
hard link keep theirs.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>

